00:06:15,497 --> 00:06:15,929
好的
Yeah.

172
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:18,400
迈克来了 你好啊迈克
Oh, Michael's here! Hi, Michael!

173
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:22,180
哟哟哟 这是哪一出
Well, well, well. What is this all about?

174
00:06:22,180 --> 00:06:24,960
那是 那是艾丽克斯的新男友吗
Is there a-a new man in Alex's life?

175
00:06:24,960 --> 00:06:26,460
她当然这样以为
Well, she certainly thinks so.

176
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:28,420
你看那家伙是直男吗
Is there any way that boy is straight?

177
00:06:28,420 --> 00:06:29,907
怎么回事 我们这是在看谁呢
Ooh, what's going on? Who are we looking at?

178
00:06:30,066 --> 00:06:32,830
那是艾丽克斯的新"男友"迈克
Uh, it's Alex's new "Boyfriend" Michael.

179
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:33,860
你打双引号是什么意思
What's up with the air quotes?

180
00:06:33,940 --> 00:06:34,960
她觉得那家伙是同志
She thinks he's gay.

181
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,660
我"觉得"他是同志就跟
I "Think" he's gay the same way

182
00:06:36,660 --> 00:06:38,200
我"觉得"这灯丑得吓人一样肯定
I "Think" that lamp is hideous.

183
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,962
好吧 我带来的 是我在艺术课上做的
Ok, brought it. Made it art class.

184
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:42,660
听着 我喜欢迈克 真的喜欢
Look, I like michael. I really do.

185
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:45,000
我只是 不希望她将来伤心
I just--I don't want her to get her heart broken.

186
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:45,760
一碰到男生
When it comes to boys,

187
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,160
她的自尊就几乎荡然无存
her self-esteem is low enough as it is.

188
00:06:47,180 --> 00:06:48,980
不知道 艾丽克斯像是很坚强的人
I don't know. Alex seems pretty darn tough.

189
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:51,680
她只是表面上很刻薄
Oh, she's just sarcastic on the outside.

190
00:06:51,760 --> 00:06:54,120
心里其实就是个脆弱的小女孩
Inside, she's just a fragile little girl.

191
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:55,860
你说那话的时候 干嘛看着我啊
By all means, look right at me when you say that.

192
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:58,700
就算她甘愿让同志伤她的心
If she wants to get her heart broken by a gay guy,

193
00:06:58,700 --> 00:07:00,680
也得等到她18或19岁的时候才行
she can do so when she's 18 or 19

194
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:02,000
到时候她可以借酒消愁
and can drink her way through it.

195
00:07:02,260 --> 00:07:03,660
哇 你真是个"好"妈妈
Aw. You're a "Good mother."

196
00:07:03,940 --> 00:07:05,120
我也说不清 克莱尔 你有可能搞错了
I don't know, Claire. You could be wrong.

197
00:07:05,260 --> 00:07:07,520
现在的男孩已经不在乎传统的男子气概那一套了
Boys aren't as concerned about traditional masculinity anymore.

198
00:07:07,743 --> 00:07:09,420
他们不会故作强硬
You know, they're not butching it up.

199
00:07:09,420 --> 00:07:10,940
他们不会压抑自己的感情
They're not pushing down their feelings.

200
00:07:10,940 --> 00:07:12,355
-是啊 他们会很在乎着装 -嗯
- Yeah, they care about their clothes. - Mm-hmm.

201
00:07:12,355 --> 00:07:13,971
-他们喜欢打扮 -嗯
- They--they--they groom. - Mm-hmm.

202
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,320
现在男人们都把汗毛刮得很干净
Everybody's hairless.

203
00:07:15,495 --> 00:07:17,335
是啊 现在已经很难从外表分辨了
Yeah, you can't tell anything anymore.

204
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:18,106
是吗
Really?

205
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:21,320
米奇舅舅 小卡舅夫 这是迈克
Uncle Mitch, uncle Cam, this is Michael.

206
00:07:21,620 --> 00:07:22,620
-嗨 -你好啊
- Hi! - Hello.

207
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:24,740
好了 快过来
Okay, come on.

208
00:07:26,520 --> 00:07:28,080
-好吧 他是基佬无疑 -我们承认错误
- Yep, he's gay. - We stand corrected.

209
00:07:31,220 --> 00:07:31,700
是啊
Yeah.

210
00:07:36,780 --> 00:07:37,260
好吧
Okay.

211
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:38,160
小心点
Now be careful.

212
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:40,020
-我可不希望你撞车 -好感动
- I don't want you to crash. -Oh, oh.

213
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:42,140
-我不希望你把我的车撞散架了 -好吧
- I don't want the bike all scratched up. - Oh.

214
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:43,440
别紧张
And don't be nervous.

215
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:45,060
人一紧张就容易犯错
People make mistakes when they're nervous.

216
00:07:45,260 --> 00:07:46,200
我才不紧张
I'm not nervous.

217
00:07:47,140 --> 00:07:49,660
曾经我胯下的"雄物" 可比这大得多
I've had bigger hogs than this between my legs.

218
00:07:54,108 --> 00:07:56,703
他真该说话前先过过脑子
He really oughta run things through his head first.

219
00:07:57,080 --> 00:07:57,520
是啊
Yeah.

220
00:07:58,980 --> 00:08:01,320
我知道我外表看上去酷毙了
I know I looked super cool on the outside,

221
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:04,140
但内心里 我怕得要死
But on the inside, I was terrified.

222
00:08:04,580 --> 00:08:05,460
然后我想起
And then I remembered

223
00:08:05,460 --> 00:08:08,860
方兹曾经在瞎眼的时候组装了一辆摩托车
that Fonzie once put together a whole motorcycle while blind.

224
00:08:08,920 --> 00:08:09,740
然后我就想
And I thought,

225
00:08:10,268 --> 00:08:11,277
那真是部好剧
That was a great show,

226
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:14,260
然后我就分散了注意力 一点都不害怕了
And I got really distracted and--and I forgot I was scared.

227
00:08:14,620 --> 00:08:17,100
所以我向峡谷开去 将城市抛在脑后
So I headed up the canyon and I left the city behind.

228
00:08:18,026 --> 00:08:19,632
我从未感到如此振奋
I'd never felt so exhilarated.

229
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:21,640
我不知道转变是何时发生的
I don't know exactly when it happened,

230
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:23,680
但在那条孤独之路上的某一刻
But somewhere on that lonely road...

231
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:25,760
车和人已经化为一体了
the bike and I became one.

232
00:08:27,442 --> 00:08:28,519
噢 不
Ohh. Oh, no.

233
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:30,020
不 靠 你好重
No. Oh, you're heavy!

234
00:08:30,216 --> 00:08:30,851
不 不要
No! Ohh!

235
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,060
把门锁上
Lock the door.

236
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,120
好吧 我们开干吧
Okay, let's do this.

237
00:08:45,540 --> 00:08:46,620
不管我们在里面发现什么
No matter what we find in here,

238
00:08:46,620 --> 00:08:47,900
我都会永远爱我妈
I will always love my mother.

239
00:08:48,100 --> 00:08:49,440
即使里面是个人头吗
Even if it's a head?

240
00:08:49,740 --> 00:08:50,920
肯定不是人头
It's not a head.

241
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:54,480
天啊 真是个人头
Oh, my god! It's a head!

242
00:08:54,699 --> 00:08:55,686
我终于说对了
Ah! Finally!

243
00:08:57,260 --> 00:08:57,660
米奇尔
Mitchell!

244
00:08:58,460 --> 00:09:00,260
我刚刚在车那边 发现我的肥桶裤都在里面
I was just in the car, and I found my fat pants in there.

245
00:09:00,300 --> 00:09:01,220
你知道是怎么回事吗
Do you know anything about that?

246
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:04,440
什么 不 是不是你忘了拿出来啊
What? No! No. Did you forget to put 'em out?

247
00:09:04,540 --> 00:09:06,080
不 记得吗 我之前摆了姿势 人们鼓掌
No. Remember? I posed, people clapped. .

248
00:09:06,160 --> 00:09:06,740
那一刻我可风光了
I had my moment

249
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:07,920
我现在想起来了
I do remember that.

250
00:09:08,295 --> 00:09:09,380
那可真是"风光一刻"
That-- oh, that was a great moment.

251
00:09:09,380 --> 00:09:10,980
我真为你骄傲
I am so proud of you.

252
00:09:12,480 --> 00:09:13,880
怎么回事 你表现得怪怪的
What's going on? You're being weird.

253
00:09:14,420 --> 00:09:15,780
怎么 你先说我是偷裤贼
What? First, I'm a pants thief

254
00:09:15,780 --> 00:09:17,580
现在我夸奖一下你也不行吗
And--and now I can't pay you a compliment?

255
00:09:17,580 --> 00:09:19,100
你知道谁才怪怪的吗 你
You know who's being weird? You.

256
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:21,180
克莱尔来了 嘿 姐们儿
Here comes Claire! Hey, girl!

257
00:09:21,180 --> 00:09:22,460
我不知道你发什么神经
I don't know what that was.

258
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:27,460
好吧 我刚看到艾丽克斯和迈克坐在树上
Okay, I just saw Alex and Michael sittin' in a tree.

259
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:28,680
别逼我把什么都说出来
Don't make me spell this out for you.

260
00:09:29,020 --> 00:09:29,960
你能怎么样呢
Well, what can you do?

261
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:32,480
我什么都干不了 但你们俩应该跟她谈谈
I can't do anything, but you two could talk to her.

262
00:09:32,560 --> 00:09:33,480
告诉她什么
And tell her what?

263
00:09:33,540 --> 00:09:34,640
迈克是"基佬队伍"中的一员
Michael's playing for the pink team.

264
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,200
好吧 我们可以自称基佬 你不能那么说
Okay, we get to say that. You don't really.

265
00:09:36,300 --> 00:09:37,740
我知道 因为你们有可信度
I know, because you have credibility,

266
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:41,180
我说话她完全不会信的 我...
And I have the opposite of credibility. I have...

267
00:09:41,720 --> 00:09:42,360
我是她妈
I am a mother.

268
00:09:42,580 --> 00:09:43,680
我们才不会干的
Okay, we're not doing this.

269
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:45,420
-不会的 -稍等 稍等一下
- No. - Well, now hold on. Just a minute.

270
00:09:45,420 --> 00:09:47,960
曾经 我还是个年少的小直男的时候
You know, when I was... young and straight,

271
00:09:48,020 --> 00:09:50,280
我也曾伤过无数少女的芳心
I left a trail of broken hearts like a rock star.

272
00:09:50,380 --> 00:09:50,860
我并不以此为荣
I'm not proud of it.

273
00:09:50,860 --> 00:09:52,060
你挺以此为荣的
Ah, you're kinda proud of it.

274
00:09:52,060 --> 00:09:53,340
你整天把这事儿挂在嘴上
You work it into a lot of conversations.

275
00:09:53,520 --> 00:09:54,500
他昨天才刚说过
He brought it up yesterday.

276
00:09:54,720 --> 00:09:56,360
好吧 我去了一家干洗店
Okay, how am I supposed to walk into a dry cleaner

277
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,600
怎么能不提我的女友温迪·乔·马丁纳斯
And not mention my girlfriend Wendy Jo Martinizer?

278
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,320
能继续说回到我的问题上吗
Can we get back to my problem?

279
00:10:00,380 --> 00:10:02,580
你根本就没什么问题 他们只不过是孩子
You don't have a problem, okay? They're kids.

280
00:10:03,060 --> 00:10:04,200
他们自己会解决的
They're gonna work it out.

281
00:10:05,180 --> 00:10:06,220
你能跟她谈谈吗
Can you talk to her?

282
00:10:06,260 --> 00:10:07,380
"他"现在这样我没法谈
Not when she's like this.

283
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:09,840
你是说艾丽克斯啊
Oh, you mean Alex.

284
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:11,600
好的 我去找她谈
Yeah. I'll do it.

285
00:10:11,860 --> 00:10:13,200
谢谢
Thank you.

286
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:15,120
克莱尔 孩子们
Claire, kids,

287
00:10:15,865 --> 00:10:17,540
如果你们看到这个 说明他们发现了我的尸体
If you're seeing this, then they found my body.

288
00:10:18,740 --> 00:10:20,700
或者我总算等到一格信号 然后给你发了邮件
Or I finally got a signal and I sent it to you in an e-mail.

289
00:10:20,794 --> 00:10:21,942
那样的话 我就直接给你打电话了 但是
In that case, I'll just call, but...

290
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:23,720
但有时候你可以接收到很强的
But sometimes you can actually get

291
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:25,540
数据传输信号 却不能进行语音通话
a pretty decent data signal and no voice.

292
00:10:26,358 --> 00:10:27,853
我知道我在胡言乱语
I know I'm not making any sense.

293
00:10:28,660 --> 00:10:30,860
我已经被困在这儿有...
I've been trapped out here now for...

294
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,240
27分钟了
27 minutes.

295
00:10:33,640 --> 00:10:34,560
我太蠢了
I'm such an idiot.

296
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:37,840
我干嘛要把这该死的摩托车骑来这里
Why did I bring this stupid motorcycle out here?

297
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,940
就为了证明我是纯爷们吗
To prove I'm a man?

298
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:40,140
我就是个纯爷们
I am a man.

299
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:43,680
妈
Mom.

300
00:10:44,248 --> 00:10:46,700
曼尼 你怎么会拿着这玩意
Manny, what's this doing here?

301
00:10:46,700 --> 00:10:49,040
如果你不介意 我们要问你几个问题
If you don't mind, we'll be asking the questions now.

302
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:50,220
我介意
I do mind.

303
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:51,580
我很抱歉
I apologize.

304
00:10:52,060 --> 00:10:53,340
我们没忍住好奇心
We couldn't help ourselves.

305
00:10:53,581 --> 00:10:54,507
但我想知道
But I've gotta know.

306
00:10:54,700 --> 00:10:55,920
你为什么要藏着这东西
Why were you hiding this?

307
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:01,460
好喜欢 我买了
Love this! Sold!

308
00:11:02,360 --> 00:11:03,560
这背后有什么故事
What's the story here?

309
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:05,800
我不想谈这个
I don't want to talk about it!

310
00:11:06,890 --> 00:11:07,659
真萌
Aw! Cute!

311
00:11:07,659 --> 00:11:08,554
那小老头是哪里来的
Oh, where'd that come from?

312
00:11:08,700 --> 00:11:10,840
是我妈妈的 但她遮遮掩掩
It's my mom's. She's being very cagey.

313
00:11:10,951 --> 00:11:12,749
我们觉得她有事瞒着我们[头部藏毒品]
We think something's stashed in the head.

314
00:11:12,860 --> 00:11:14,320
那可是从哥伦比亚带来的
It's from Colombia.

315
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:16,900
妈 有什么大不了的
Mom, what's the big deal?

316
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:19,580
好吧 我说
Okay, fine.

317
00:11:20,620 --> 00:11:23,400
我年轻时 参加过一场选美比赛
When I was young, I was in a beauty pageant.

318
00:11:23,657 --> 00:11:25,452
其他参赛的女孩们 在才艺秀环节
All the other girls, for their talent,

319
00:11:25,620 --> 00:11:28,560
都一如既往地选择表演耍大刀
were juggling knives, as they always do.

320
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,540
但我想表现得与众不同
But I wanted to stand out,

321
00:11:31,180 --> 00:11:32,800
所以我决定表演
so I came up with...

322
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:33,760
《臭脾气大叔》
Uncle Grumpy.

323
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:36,560
好吧 我从没如此激动过
Okay. Never been so happy.

324
00:11:36,560 --> 00:11:37,520
不看完这一出我绝不走
Not leaving till I see it.

325
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:37,920
来吧 歌洛莉亚
Hit it, Gloria.

326
00:11:38,072 --> 00:11:39,580
打扰一下 这个花瓶多少钱
Excuse me, how much is this vase?

327
00:11:39,580 --> 00:11:40,220
给你了 拿走吧
It's yours. Take it.

328
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:40,940
你需要什么道具
So what do you need here?

329
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,120
大板凳 还是要喝水
A stool? Glass of water?

330
00:11:42,260 --> 00:11:42,940
要怎么才能开始
How do we make this happen?

331
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:43,840
来吧 我要看
Let's go. I need to see this.

332
00:11:43,920 --> 00:11:44,980
没什么可看的
You see nothing.

333
00:11:45,620 --> 00:11:49,160
那次选美是我这辈子最糟糕的一晚
That pageant was one of the worst nights of my life.

334
00:11:49,760 --> 00:11:51,680
我排练了好几个星期
After weeks of rehearsing,

335
00:11:52,780 --> 00:11:55,331
但一上场就呆住了 我俩都说不出话来
I froze, and we were speechless.

336
00:11:55,613 --> 00:11:56,742
结果你输了
Aw, and you lost.

337
00:11:57,560 --> 00:11:59,040
不 我赢了
No. I won.

338
00:11:59,300 --> 00:12:01,340
想象一下我18岁时的曼妙身姿
Imagine this when I was 18.

339
00:12:02,380 --> 00:12:04,440
但那晚我太丢人了
But it was very humiliating.

340
00:12:05,760 --> 00:12:07,760
我再也不想做那个表演了
I don't want to do it ever again.

341
00:12:08,060 --> 00:12:09,680
但这么多年你还一直收藏着他
And yet, you kept him all these years.

342
00:12:10,520 --> 00:12:12,940
也许你心里还是希望能重来一遍
Maybe there's a part of you that wants to work through this,

343
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:13,580
弥补当年的遗憾
get some closure.

344
00:12:14,580 --> 00:12:16,680
你说的不对 陌生小哥
You're wrong, whoever you are.

345
00:12:20,420 --> 00:12:21,820
已经过去31分钟了
It's going on 31 minutes.

346
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:24,200
感觉好寂寞
I feel so alone.

347
00:12:26,540 --> 00:12:28,760
我得把腿挣脱出来
I gotta get my leg free.

348
00:12:36,359 --> 00:12:40,158
我怎么没穿我的双节裤啊
Why didn't I wear my shants?!

349
00:12:42,520 --> 00:12:44,080
伙计们 来看看
Hey, guys. Check it out.

350
00:12:44,140 --> 00:12:44,960
喜欢我的新手镯吗
You like my new bracelet?

351
00:12:45,125 --> 00:12:45,814
真好看
Ooh, cute.

352
00:12:45,940 --> 00:12:47,720
迈克用那边一个旧窗帘环做的
It's an old curtain ring Michael saw over there.

353
00:12:48,041 --> 00:12:49,548
他在上面编了三条皮鞋带
He braided three leather shoelaces around it

354
00:12:49,660 --> 00:12:50,240
就做成了
And voila.

355
00:12:53,820 --> 00:12:56,920
你知道吗 艾丽克斯 看到你和迈克
You know, Alex, you and Michael remind me so much

356
00:12:56,920 --> 00:12:58,500
让我想起我和我的第一任女友
of me and my first girlfriend

357
00:12:58,520 --> 00:12:59,320
安娜贝尔·皮卡特
Annabelle Pickett.

358
00:13:00,112 --> 00:13:01,140
是吗 你还交过女朋友吗
Huh? You had a girlfriend?

359
00:13:01,140 --> 00:13:02,960
是的 而且是主日学校的校花呢
Yeah. Cutest girl in Sunday school, too.

360
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:05,120
有一年 我邀请她一起参加
So one year, I asked her to go

361
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:06,840
教堂举办的《我爱记歌词》比赛
to the church bazaar lip sync contest with me,

362
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:09,240
表演了我们自己改编的《无尽的爱》
and we did our version of "Endless Love"...

363
00:13:09,380 --> 00:13:11,340
说来很讽刺 因为两星期后
which was ironic because two weeks later,

364
00:13:11,780 --> 00:13:12,980
我被一个名叫伍迪·雷的
I fell head over heels

365
00:13:12,980 --> 00:13:16,020
年轻方下巴竞技场检票员迷得神魂颠倒
for a young square-jawed rodeo ticket taker named Woody Ray.

366
00:13:16,260 --> 00:13:16,740
天呐
Oh, no.

367
00:13:16,740 --> 00:13:19,100
可想而知 她心碎欲绝 痛不欲生
Of course, she was devastated, just destroyed her.

368
00:13:19,100 --> 00:13:21,160
之后她用油漆在我爸爸的畜棚外
And then she spray-painted something unrepeatable

369
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:21,860
写上了非常难听的话
on my daddy's barn

370
00:13:21,860 --> 00:13:22,820
然后再也没有理过我
and never spoke to me again.

371
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:23,980
哇 其实一切都是因为
Wow, and all because

372
00:13:23,980 --> 00:13:25,795
她想强行把你掰成直男
she wanted you to be something you just weren't.

373
00:13:26,254 --> 00:13:26,865
是的 没错
Mm-hmm. Yeah.

374
00:13:26,865 --> 00:13:28,140
打住 我听明白了
Ugh. Stop. I get it.

375
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:29,760
我知道你心里怎么看迈克 妈
I know what you think about Michael, mom.

376
00:13:29,860 --> 00:13:32,240
你没必要搬出你的基友恶势力来打压我
You didn't have to bring in your big gay guns to back you up.

377
00:13:32,880 --> 00:13:33,600
无意冒犯
No offense.

378
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:35,020
-没关系 -我还挺爱听的
- None taken. - I kinda like it.

379
00:13:35,020 --> 00:13:37,140
好吧 宝贝 我是为你担心
Okay. Honey, I am worried about you.

380
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:38,400
我不想让你受到伤害
I don't want you to get hurt.

381
00:13:38,540 --> 00:13:40,500
我跟他们说过这是个馊主意 好吗
I told them that this was a bad idea, all right?

382
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:43,440
迈克也许是同志 也许不是
You know, maybe Michael's gay. Maybe he's not.

383
00:13:43,640 --> 00:13:44,220
他肯定是
He is.

384
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:46,580
你妈妈只是想让你看清事实
Your mother just wants you to have all the information

385
00:13:46,580 --> 00:13:48,100
这样你就能慢慢来
so that--that you can go slow.

386
00:13:48,100 --> 00:13:49,980
米奇尔舅舅 他是直男
Uncle Mitchell, he's straight.

387
00:13:50,860 --> 00:13:51,560
我们接吻了
We kissed.

388
00:13:52,743 --> 00:13:53,901
天真的孩子 我...
Oh, honey, I...

389
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:56,820
我想做直男时 也和很多女孩接过吻
I kissed a lot of girls when I wanted to be straight.

390
00:13:56,820 --> 00:13:59,140
你小卡舅夫也声称他亲过几个女孩
And your uncle cam kissed some, too, he says.

391
00:13:59,140 --> 00:14:00,680
但那都不重要
But that's neither here nor there.

392
00:14:00,803 --> 00:14:03,006
重要的是你要清楚自己的...你...
What's important is that you make your own--where--

393
00:14:03,006 --> 00:14:03,620
等等 你要去哪里
Wait, where are you going?

394
00:14:03,620 --> 00:14:05,100
你们那旧时代已经过去了
It's not the olden days anymore, you guys.

395
00:14:05,160 --> 00:14:06,560
我直接问他就好
I can just ask him.

396
00:14:07,060 --> 00:14:08,180
-这下你开心了吧 -才怪
- Hope you're happy. - I'm not.

397
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:10,000
"旧时代"三个字直接戳到我的痛处
That "Olden days" comment was like a punch to the gut.

398
00:14:10,171 --> 00:14:11,986
她不如直接用喷漆喷在我爸的谷仓上呢
She may as well have spray-painted it on my daddy's barn.

399
00:14:11,986 --> 00:14:12,508
我不管这事儿了
Yeah, I'm done with this.

400
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:13,700
他干嘛去
Where's he going?

401
00:14:14,680 --> 00:14:15,660
嘿 你有面包吗
Hey, you got any bread?

402
00:14:15,800 --> 00:14:17,446
我想确认下这个还能用不
I wanna make sure this thing till works.

403
00:14:17,446 --> 00:14:18,489
少指望我来给你服务
Yeah, that' not gonna happen.

404
00:14:18,820 --> 00:14:19,900
不一定非得是面包
Oh, it doesn't have to be bread.

405
00:14:19,940 --> 00:14:21,520
我也可以用
I mean, I can get the information I need

406
00:14:21,520 --> 00:14:23,880
面包圈或者冷冻的华夫饼来试
From, like, a bagel or a frozen waffle.

407
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:24,260
孩子 听好
Look, kid,

408
00:14:24,260 --> 00:14:26,280
你不如掷色子听天由命吧
You're just gonna have to roll the dice on this one.

409
00:14:27,340 --> 00:14:28,080
我不知道
I don't know.

410
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:30,000
退货规定是什么
What's your return policy?

411
00:14:30,294 --> 00:14:31,969
你敢退货 我就报警
You return, I call the police.

412
00:14:32,740 --> 00:14:33,480
你从哪儿拿的
Where'd you get that?

413
00:14:34,100 --> 00:14:36,040
-从厨房 -那个不卖 给我拿来
- From the kitchen. - Give me that!

414
00:14:38,827 --> 00:14:39,780
你的宠物猪卖吗
You selling the pot-bellied pig?

415
00:14:39,780 --> 00:14:40,620
立刻从我眼前消失
Get out of my driveway.

416
00:14:43,580 --> 00:14:44,680
你不是猪
You're not a pig.

417
00:14:45,460 --> 00:14:46,700
你是爹地的乖女儿
You're daddy's little girl.

418
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:52,060
你在这儿呀
There you are.

419
00:14:52,900 --> 00:14:53,820
嘿 抱歉
Hey. Sorry.

420
00:14:53,942 --> 00:14:55,618
我看《艾尔装饰》看得入迷了
I got lost in this "Elle decor".

421
00:14:55,740 --> 00:14:59,240
贾斯汀·汀布莱克正设计他的住宅
Justin Timberlake is designing his own home line,

422
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:01,040
我对此保留意见
and I'm trying to reserve judgment.

423
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:04,240
迈克 我要问你个事儿
Michael I have to ask you something.

424
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:07,840
我希望你明白 无论真实的你是怎样的都没关系
I want you to know it's okay either way.

425
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:10,720
但是...
But...

426
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:11,280
你是同志吗
Are you gay?

427
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:12,280
什么
What?

428
00:15:13,280 --> 00:15:14,440
不 我不是
No! I'm not!

429
00:15:14,668 --> 00:15:16,140
我 我的舞伴是你
I--I took you to prom.

430
00:15:16,140 --> 00:15:17,240
我吻的也是你
I kissed you.

431
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:19,860
除非你是男孩 不然我绝对是直男
Unless you're a boy, I'm pretty sure I'm straight.

432
00:15:20,092 --> 00:15:21,300
你是男孩吗
Are--are you a boy?

433
00:15:21,300 --> 00:15:21,860
不是
No.

434
00:15:22,140 --> 00:15:24,120
对嘛 所以我是直男
Right. So then I'm straight.

435
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:26,240
我没想惹你发火
I didn't mean to make you mad.

436
00:15:26,320 --> 00:15:28,480
我没发火 我就是...
I'm not mad. I'm just...

437
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:29,200
愤怒
Angry.

438
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:31,140
对不起
I'm sorry.

439
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:33,380
其实那两个是同义词
And those are synonyms.

440
00:15:33,740 --> 00:15:35,700
你就是无所不知是吧
You just know everything today.

441
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:37,620
让我一人待会儿行吗
Can you just give me a minute?

442
00:15:49,220 --> 00:15:50,920
小哥 你坐这儿有何贵干[需要帮忙吗]
Hey, Can I help you?

443
00:15:51,140 --> 00:15:53,460
需要 为什么大家都觉得我是同志
Yeah. Why does everybody think I'm gay?

444
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:56,040
老天 我恨大甩卖
God, I hate yard sales.

445
00:16:00,480 --> 00:16:01,360
谢谢你
Thank you.

446
00:16:03,576 --> 00:16:06,263
很抱歉乱翻 翻出了你的老头玩偶
Sorry for snooping around and finding your old man doll.

447
00:16:06,420 --> 00:16:09,080
在哥伦比亚 如果你翻错了箱子
In colombia, if you snoop around the wrong box,

448
00:16:09,080 --> 00:16:11,140
直接让你沉尸箱中
you might end up inside that box.

449
00:16:11,360 --> 00:16:12,460
我知道我错了
I shouldn't have done it.

450
00:16:12,640 --> 00:16:13,800
现在我挺替曼尼难过的
Now I feel bad for Manny.

451
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,120
什么意思
What do you mean?

452
00:16:16,860 --> 00:16:18,120
该怎么说呢
Well, I don't know.

453
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,960
他总把你的勇敢挂在嘴边
He's always talking about how brave you are,

454
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:21,240
说你无所畏惧
how you're not afraid of anything.

455
00:16:22,060 --> 00:16:23,980
现在他看起来有点失望
Now... he just seems a little sad.

456
00:16:24,180 --> 00:16:24,840
有多失望
How sad?

457
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:26,800
别担心 这样挺好
Don't worry. It's a good thing.

458
00:16:27,060 --> 00:16:28,460
他需要用现实来醒脑
He needs a little dose of reality.

459
00:16:28,960 --> 00:16:29,780
在校园里
You walk around school,

460
00:16:29,780 --> 00:16:31,920
到处跟人说自己妈有多棒
telling everyone how great your mommy is all the time,

461
00:16:32,320 --> 00:16:34,160
最终只会让自己受伤疼痛
you find yourself on the business end of a wedgie.

462
00:16:36,760 --> 00:16:39,240
我知道怎么用激将法得到我想要的
I know how to push buttons to get what I want.

463
00:16:39,660 --> 00:16:42,180
我想要的是一场玩偶秀
And what I want is to see a puppet show.

464
00:16:44,155 --> 00:16:45,152
我控诉
J'accuse!

465
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:47,040
不好意思 你说什么
I'm sorry. One more time?

466
00:16:47,120 --> 00:16:48,840
只是用戏剧化的方式控诉你罢了
It's just a dramatic way of accusing you...

467
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:50,880
竟然把我的大码牛仔裤藏到灌木丛
Of stashing my fat pants in a bush!

468
00:16:51,660 --> 00:16:53,040
-真会耍阴谋 -第二种控诉方式
- Saboteur! - That's a second way.

469
00:16:53,280 --> 00:16:54,960
你...怎么...能够
How... could... you?

470
00:16:55,080 --> 00:16:55,860
第三种
And a third.

471
00:16:56,220 --> 00:16:57,220
为什么 米奇尔 为什么
Why, Mitchell? Why?

472
00:16:57,430 --> 00:16:58,255
小卡 别这样
Cam... oh, come on.

473
00:16:58,634 --> 00:16:59,095
好吧 其实...
All right, the...

474
00:16:59,460 --> 00:17:02,020
我有点难以启齿 但是...
This is a little hard to say, but...

475
00:17:02,580 --> 00:17:04,660
每次你丢掉这些大码裤子
Every time you get rid of these pants,

476
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:06,340
都会重新再买回来
You have to buy them all over again,

477
00:17:06,491 --> 00:17:08,018
然后你会郁闷 明白吗
and you get depressed, all right?

478
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:11,280
我那么做只是为了留条后路
This is just a way to have a safety net.

479
00:17:11,320 --> 00:17:12,960
我不能留后路 米奇尔
I can't have a safety net, Mitchell.

480
00:17:13,020 --> 00:17:15,220
否则我无法减肥成功
Otherwise, I won't be successful and keep the weight off.

481
00:17:15,380 --> 00:17:16,620
你就没想过那一点吗
Have you ever thought of that?

482
00:17:18,020 --> 00:17:19,380
没有 我没想过
No. No, I didn't.

483
00:17:19,900 --> 00:17:21,620
我跟你一样记得那些
You know, you're not the only one who remembers

484
00:17:21,620 --> 00:17:22,787
减肥失败的惨痛经历
all the times I failed.

485
00:17:25,100 --> 00:17:25,900
你说得对
You're right.

486
00:17:26,911 --> 00:17:29,280
我应该更支持你才对 对不起
I--I should support you more. I'm--I'm sorry.

487
00:17:29,280 --> 00:17:30,120
你能这么说我感到好幸福
I'm happy to hear you say that.

488
00:17:30,180 --> 00:17:31,320
你幸福我就幸福
Well, I'm happy you're happy.

489
00:17:31,420 --> 00:17:32,720
那么祝你俩幸福
Well, I hope you both are happy.

490
00:17:33,060 --> 00:17:34,740
迈克不是同性恋 现在他恨死我了
Michael's not gay. Now he hates me.

491
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:35,780
真是多谢你们
Thanks a lot.

492
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:37,660
你看
You see?

493
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:39,940
就是因为这样 我才不想掺和这事儿
This is exactly why I didn't want to get involved.

494
00:17:42,060 --> 00:17:43,240
我好难过
Now I feel terrible.

495
00:17:44,060 --> 00:17:46,620
难过时吃馅饼再合适不过了
These feelings would go good with pie.

496
00:17:49,380 --> 00:17:50,840
你回来啦
There he is!

497
00:17:54,400 --> 00:17:55,820
亲爱的 喜欢吗
Sweetheart, do you love it?

498
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:57,180
不 克莱尔 我不喜欢
No, Claire, I do not love it.

499
00:17:57,340 --> 00:18:00,140
太可惜了 车帅人俊 酷毙了
Oh, that's too bad 'cause you look so cool on that.

500
00:18:00,260 --> 00:18:02,120
是吗 克莱尔 真的吗
Do I, Claire? Do I really?

501
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:03,460
发生什么事了
What happened?

502
00:18:03,622 --> 00:18:05,275
说来话长 你自己看留言信箱吧
It's a long story. Check your in-box.

503
00:18:05,760 --> 00:18:07,680
这么说吧 我不会买这辆摩托车的
But suffice it to say, I'm not buying that motorcycle.

504
00:18:08,395 --> 00:18:09,383
-好 -我知道自己是谁 克莱尔
- Uh-huh. - I know what I am, Clare.

505
00:18:09,540 --> 00:18:11,380
我不是摩托车手 我是"阔步车"手
I'm not a rider. I'm a strider.

506
00:18:12,060 --> 00:18:14,720
希望这对你来说够性感
I hope that's sexy enough for you.

507
00:18:15,364 --> 00:18:16,157
我的确看到了你性感的下半身
Well, I can see stuff.

508
00:18:16,240 --> 00:18:17,760
我知道 我感觉有风吹过
Yeah, I know. I can feel air on it.

509
00:18:17,980 --> 00:18:19,520
我又没有后备的裤子
It's not like I have another pair of pants.

510
00:18:19,677 --> 00:18:21,623
今天你够幸运
Oh, uh, today is your lucky day.

511
00:18:22,220 --> 00:18:23,340
都是为了慈善
It's for a good cause.

512
00:18:24,100 --> 00:18:25,080
你可能需要皮带
You might need a belt.

513
00:18:25,340 --> 00:18:27,260
不用吧 我想我们穿同一码
Oh, I doubt it. I bet we wear the same size.

514
00:18:27,300 --> 00:18:28,260
少来这套
Don't do that.

515
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:29,020
明白
Copy.

516
00:18:31,000 --> 00:18:33,480
顺便说下 我们毁了艾丽克斯的生活
Well, we ruined Alex's life, by the way.

517
00:18:34,020 --> 00:18:35,440
还好吧 她挺好的
I don't know. She looks okay.

518
00:18:36,923 --> 00:18:38,191
看起来他们和好了
Oh, looks like they made up.

519
00:18:39,060 --> 00:18:39,980
如果她肯听我的话
If she would just listen to me,

520
00:18:39,980 --> 00:18:41,480
我可以帮她避免好多心痛
I could help her avoid so much pain.

521
00:18:41,580 --> 00:18:43,660
别插手她的事了 她才14岁
Give it a rest. She's 14, all right?

522
00:18:43,840 --> 00:18:45,980
无论那个男生是谁 感情都不会长久的
No matter who that boy is, he's not gonna last.

523
00:18:46,175 --> 00:18:46,782
你说得对
Mm, you're right.

524
00:18:46,782 --> 00:18:47,779
至少和一个同志小哥在一起
Well, at leas with a gay kid,

525
00:18:47,779 --> 00:18:49,644
他可以插花给她欣赏
you know she's gonna get a great flower arrangement.

526
00:18:50,001 --> 00:18:51,790
你们应该瞧瞧我给安娜贝尔插的花
Should've seen the one I made Annabelle.

527
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:53,280
全是我亲手插的 美极了
Arranged it myself. It was gorgeous...

528
00:18:54,120 --> 00:18:56,040
直到她把花拔出来 在我家门廊上拼出"基佬"字样
Till she pulled it apart and spelled "Homo" on my porch.

529
00:18:57,740 --> 00:18:59,000
你这话对我没啥安慰作用
This doesn't make me feel any better.

530
00:18:59,860 --> 00:19:01,180
大家过来吧
Gather around everybody.

531
00:19:01,820 --> 00:19:03,280
我想给各位介绍一个人
I want you to meet somebody.

532
00:19:03,740 --> 00:19:04,760
瞧这个我就开心了
Oh, but that might.

533
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:05,620
臭脾气大叔
Uncle Grumpy.

534
00:19:07,518 --> 00:19:09,842
卢克的一番慧语让我顿悟
Luke's wise words got to me.

535
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:12,720
我要我的儿子再次尊敬我
I needed my son to respect me again.

536
00:19:13,420 --> 00:19:16,120
不仅如此 我还需要重拾自尊
More than that, I needed to respect myself.

537
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:18,620
我滴个娘哦
Holy maracas!

538
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:22,060
我算是坐对大腿了
I think I sat on the right lap!

539
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:25,040
臭脾气大叔 我们在公众场合呢
Uncle Grumpy, we're in public.

540
00:19:25,700 --> 00:19:28,400
瞧这些白种人
Ay, look at all those white faces!

541
00:19:28,529 --> 00:19:31,823
看来我们是越境成功了
I see we made it over the wall.

542
00:19:32,080 --> 00:19:33,960
臭脾气大叔 你心情不好吗
Uncle grumpy, are you in a bad mood?

543
00:19:34,300 --> 00:19:38,060
他妈的说对了 我刚看完电影
Damn right I am! I just came from the movies.

544
00:19:38,186 --> 00:19:42,502
一天工资全买票看《本能》了
A whole day's pay to see "Basic instinct."

545
00:19:42,637 --> 00:19:44,762
你觉得怎么样
Oh. And what did you think?

546
00:19:45,148 --> 00:19:47,485
基"本"上 很烂[能]
Basically, it stinked.

547
00:19:48,460 --> 00:19:50,060
你脾气太臭了
You're so grumpy.

548
00:19:50,800 --> 00:19:52,220
他妈的说对了
Damn right I am!

549
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:55,080
我刚碰到了我的梦中情人
I just met the girl of my dreams.

550
00:19:55,763 --> 00:19:57,284
真是太好了
Ay, that's such great news.

551
00:19:57,421 --> 00:20:00,610
才怪 她把白蚁传染给了我
No. She gave me the termites.

552
00:20:01,585 --> 00:20:02,726
歌洛莉亚 我打算...
Gloria, I'm just gonna--

553
00:20:03,048 --> 00:20:03,867
老天 我连知道的兴趣都没有
Oh, jeez. I don't even wanna know what this is.

554
00:20:03,867 --> 00:20:04,696
我走了
I'm outta here.

555
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:07,000
-你要出去吗 -他妈的说对了
- You're leaving? - Damn right.

556
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:08,940
大甩卖和"擅闯民宅"的唯一区别在于
The only difference between this and a home invasion

557
00:20:08,940 --> 00:20:10,780
我可以冲擅闯民宅的人开枪
is I get to shoot people at a home invasion.

558
00:20:11,840 --> 00:20:14,740
我的天 她嫁的人跟她的木偶一样
Oh, my god. She married her puppet.

559
00:20:19,420 --> 00:20:20,380
臭脾气大叔
Uncle Grumpy!

560
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:26,000
有人听到吗
Can anyone hear me?!

561
00:20:27,640 --> 00:20:28,920
救命啊
Please help me!

562
00:20:29,830 --> 00:20:31,118
我不想死啊
I don't wanna die!

563
00:20:31,560 --> 00:20:33,640
如果我必须弄个歌曲播放列表
If I had to make a playlist

564
00:20:33,640 --> 00:20:35,600
用于困在摩托车下时听的话
for being trapped under a motorcycle,

565
00:20:35,600 --> 00:20:36,372
会有
It'd be, um...

566
00:20:37,820 --> 00:20:40,080
《无法动弹》 《上路吧 杰克》
"Stuck in the middle," "Hit the road Jack,"

567
00:20:40,895 --> 00:20:42,647
重炮D唱的随便什么歌
Um, anything by Heavy D.

568
00:20:43,885 --> 00:20:45,727
指针姐妹的《困兽之舞》
Ooh, Pointer sisters, "Neutron dance."

569
00:20:46,220 --> 00:20:48,480
原来 今天不是
Turns out today wasn't

570
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:50,520
我未来人生的崭新一页
the first day of the rest of my life.

571
00:20:52,520 --> 00:20:53,520
我的天
Oh, my goodness.

572
00:20:53,667 --> 00:20:56,820
我衣柜里有个鞋盒里面有些DVD
There's some DVDs in a shoe box in, uh,my closet

573
00:20:56,820 --> 00:20:58,580
那是一哥们儿放我家暂存的
that I was holding for... a buddy.

574
00:20:58,580 --> 00:21:01,800
直接把盒子扔掉就行了
Um, you can go ahead and just throw the whole box away.

575
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,200
我好饿
I'm so hungry.

576
00:21:15,100 --> 00:21:16,720
不知道要在这里困多久
I don't know how long I'm gonna be out here.

577
00:21:18,124 --> 00:21:19,557
我得吃点保命的粮食了
I gotta ration my food.

578
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:29,380
我说了不要加番茄的
I said no tomatoes!
